  "details": "While using full body tracking, an avatar's neck, spine, chest area stretches locally while using vive or oculus quest controllers, (potentially more, I don't have anything else to test with)\nThis only occurs locally, causing desync between users.\nThis behaviour does not happen with index controllers.\nIt can be replicated and exemplified by powering off a tracker so lower body tracking freezes, follwed by playspacing up or down.",
